1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,520
deal with is not soft drinks, but don't drink them.

2
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:12,720
The most difficult sin for Christ to deal with is not short skirts, but don't wear

3
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,720
them.

4
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,480
It is pride.

5
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:21,800
You see, I can see the short skirt, I can't see the pride.

6
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:28,560
I'll ask you again.

7
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:32,640
Jesus told the rich young ruler, yet lackest thou?

8
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:37,000
Come on, tell me.

9
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:42,520
The rich young ruler is dead, so Christ is speaking to us.

10
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:46,120
What is that one thing you lack?

11
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:48,760
Don't tell me.

12
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:56,960
Try and get it, and you can only get it through Jesus Christ.

13
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:57,960
What is that?

14
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,960
On another occasion, in Mark chapter 12.

